fea3c95.mp4?t=1696250396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Master your workflow</strong><br>Harvest the plants from your outdoor garden, take them to the seed extractor to get their pure element, use the mortar to boost the element and pour them to the cauldron. Certain customers may request for additional effects on potion, so be sure to add the special ingredients that will create these desired side effects. Also, you will need to investigate the <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083220/extras/15a01b9d603a1f1be373d8d1aff32eed.poster.avif?t=1696250396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083220/extras/15a01b9d603a1f1be373d8d1aff32eed.webm?t=1696250396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083220/extras/15a01b9d603a1f1be373d8d1aff32eed.mp4?t=1696250396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Decorate your store</strong><br>Earn coins for each potion you sell! With your earnings, you will be able to decorate your shop and buy new optional tools to be more efficient and brew even more potions in less time. You will also be able to customize your hands, decorate your shops with all kinds of objects, and more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083220/extras/fb70d3d2bd9028cfb79dcf380d514fdd.poster.avif?t=1696250396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083220/extras/fb70d3d2bd9028cfb79dcf380d514fdd.webm?t=1696250396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083220/extras/fb70d3d2bd9028cfb79dcf380d514fdd.mp4?t=1696250396\" type=\"video/mp4\">